claim.claim-text:
a cutting tube (1112) configured to be oscillated and having an inner lumen (1110);
a cutting sleeve having a side opening for cutting in guillotine style fashion wherein the cutting sleeve is inserted over the cutting tube (1112) such that the cutting tube (1112) extends through and is coaxially arranged within the cutting sleeve; and
an aspiration pump (1014) housed within the disposable portion and fluidly coupled to the inner lumen (1110) of the cutting tube (1112), and releaseably operatively coupled to the pump motor (1115) of the proximal, reusable portion (1033) to drive the aspiration pump (1014) by the aspiration pump motor (1115),
